          "id": 630983795,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Well, section numbers are meant to be brief tags for finding wordy information. I figured we'd want to be brief in a tooltip. If the section numbers change regularly then there's no choice, and we'll have to change them to this instead:\n\n> See \"A common mistake with !=\" in the Help for details.\n\n> See \"Sometimes fields change names\" in the Help for details.\n\n(Assuming the titles are more stable than the section numbers.)",
